5,25)\">Isa 5:25</ref>. <b>d</b> <highlightword>of house</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Ps 101:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"101\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"101\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,101,2)\">Ps 101:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 101:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"101\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"101\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,101,7)\">Ps 101:7</ref> temple <ref ref=\"Ps 48:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,48,10)\">Ps 48:10</ref> <bdbheb>מוֺעֲ דֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 74:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,4)\">Ps 74:4</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> of land (earth) <ref ref=\"Gen 45:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,45,6)\">Gen 45:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 48:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,48,16)\">Gen 48:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 2:3\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,3)\">Amos 2:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 5:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,8)\">Isa 5:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 24:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,24,13)\">Isa 24:13</ref> (|| <bdbheb>בְּתוֺח הָעַמִּים</bdbheb>), + 10 t. (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִקּ</bdbheb>). <b>feminine</b> <highlightword>of a number of person</highlightword>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כְּק</bdbheb> <highlight>in the midst, among</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִקּ</bdbheb> <highlight>from among</highlight>: especially (1) people (96 t.; 80 t. as singular collective, 15 t. plural <ref ref=\"Amos 7:8\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,8)\">Amos 7:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 24:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,3)\">Gen 24:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 23:25\" b=\"2\" 